# One line-ending style everywhere: LF in the repository and in every working tree, Windows included.
# Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checks files out as CRLF, and tools that write LF
# (npm, the build, editors) make files look modified and block `git pull` / `git merge`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries are never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
